    <Section level={3} title="Open a filter panel under its button">
        <p>The panel is open for as long as it is bound, so its <code>&#123;#if&#125;</code>
            opens and closes it. It sits in the top layer, placed on the side it is given and
            flipped where there is no room, and <code>data-side</code> says which it took. Bind
            <code>dismissible</code> beside it to close it on a press outside or on Escape.</p>
        <Example code={filterPanel}><FilterPanel /></Example>
    </Section>

    <Section level={3} title="Make a list as wide as the field it suggests for">
        <p><code>--anchor-width</code> is the anchor's width, kept current as it resizes.</p>
        <Example code={anchorWidth}><AnchorWidth /></Example>
